# WiFi is OFF by default: an idle radio is battery and heat spent on nothing. Device Sync does not
# need this file (it opens its own hotspot). Turn it on only if you want SSH access to the device.
#
# To enable: rename this file to wifi.txt and put your network on one line as SSID:password.
# Lines starting with # are ignored. The first network listed is the one used.
#
# MyNetwork:mypassword
